  "question": {
    "text": "The minimum value of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> exists, when <math><mi>Z</mi></math> is equal to (where,&nbsp;<math><mi>Z</mi></math> is a complex number)"
  },
