  "solution": {
    "text": "Given expression is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, minimum <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to <math><mn>1</mn></math>, when <math><mi>Z</mi></math> lies on the line segment joining <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />And, minimum <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to <math><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;when&nbsp;<math><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Minimum <math><mn>6</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to <math><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> at <math><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>"
  }
